[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3943591460","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116641#issuecomment-3943591460","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116641","id":3943591460,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7rDm4k","user":{"login":"AdriaandeJongh","id":5611323,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MTEzMjM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5611323?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh","html_url":"https://github.com/AdriaandeJongh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-23T09:27:42Z","updated_at":"2026-02-23T09:27:42Z","body":"… but now the red folder is brown :P","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3943591460/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3943779357","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116641#issuecomment-3943779357","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116641","id":3943779357,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7rEUwd","user":{"login":"Scrawach","id":40476180,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNDc2MTgw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40476180?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach","html_url":"https://github.com/Scrawach","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-23T10:03:11Z","updated_at":"2026-02-23T11:21:44Z","body":"Yep, but it was like this in previous versions too. It's just regression fix. I've also been thinking about fixing this, but it's hard for me to predict what it will affect. And, perhaps, it's supposed to work that way :D\r\n\r\nOne of the possible solutions. It's required this code changes in themes:\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\n//p_theme->set_icon(\"folder_thumbnail\", \"FileDialog\", p_theme->get_icon(\"FolderBigThumb\", EditorStringName(EditorIcons)));\r\np_theme->set_color(\"folder_icon_color\", \"FileDialog\", (Color(1, 1, 1)).lerp(p_config.accent_color, 0.7));\r\n```\r\nAs result:\r\n<img width=\"406\" height=\"232\" alt=\"result\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/70281f6d-c0ac-4a3b-b513-b9aa35b09a37\" />\r\n\r\nBut it's required paint Folder.svg (`editor\\icons\\Folder.svg`) to white color, because file dock icons use this icons and `folder_icon_color` together. Yes, it's a bit confusing right now because of the different colors of similar icons.\r\n\r\nBut it's another issue with that:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"617\" height=\"91\" alt=\"issue\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fa6dde8e-705d-4f02-a5c9-4adc19457797\" />\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3943779357/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3944283526","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116641#issuecomment-3944283526","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116641","id":3944283526,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7rGP2G","user":{"login":"Scrawach","id":40476180,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNDc2MTgw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40476180?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach","html_url":"https://github.com/Scrawach","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-23T11:44:41Z","updated_at":"2026-02-23T11:44:41Z","body":"Another solution would be to multiply folders color by a constant, as it's done in other places. But the red color will still be darker here.\r\n\r\nIn `EditorFileDialog`:\r\n```cpp\r\nColor EditorFileDialog::_get_folder_color(const String &p_path) const {\r\n\tColor default_color = FileDialog::_get_folder_color(p_path);\r\n\tColor folder_color = FileSystemDock::get_dir_icon_color(p_path, default_color);\r\n\r\n\tif (!EditorThemeManager::is_dark_icon_and_font() && folder_color != default_color) {\r\n\t\tfolder_color *= FileSystemDock::ITEM_COLOR_SCALE;\r\n\t}\r\n\r\n\treturn folder_color;\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n<img width=\"406\" height=\"231\" alt=\"trying_fix\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1ccde31a-f963-45f5-84c2-bd352db727cf\" />\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3944283526/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4238166415","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116641#issuecomment-4238166415","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116641","id":4238166415,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc78nUmP","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"